{"id":"e659db66dc4dd9b2","group":"93","path":"93/93-df-jep.md","title":"Joint Embedding Property","display":"df-jep — Joint Embedding Property","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Algebraizable Logics","book_abbrev":"93","label":"93-df-jep","aliases":["93-df-jep"],"display":"df-jep — Joint Embedding Property","depends_on":["[[93-df-embedding]]","[[93-df-common-extension]]","[[93-df-similarity-type]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Algebraizable Logics"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"93"},{"key":"label","html":"93-df-jep"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>93-df-jep</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-jep — Joint Embedding Property"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"d611f4ac8b8895ab\" href=\"?note=d611f4ac8b8895ab\" title=\"93-df-embedding\">93-df-embedding</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"d541ac78ed69cf9f\" href=\"?note=d541ac78ed69cf9f\" title=\"93-df-common-extension\">93-df-common-extension</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"ee84ed8b0fae5bc3\" href=\"?note=ee84ed8b0fae5bc3\" title=\"93-df-similarity-type\">93-df-similarity-type</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal K\\subseteq\\{\\mathbf A:\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}(\\mathbf A)\\}\">\\(\\mathcal K\\subseteq\\{\\mathbf A:\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}(\\mathbf A)\\}\\)</span> is a class of algebras of one fixed similarity type.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SimType}_{93}\">\\(\\mathrm{SimType}_{93}\\)</span> is the one-place similarity-type predicate of <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"ee84ed8b0fae5bc3\" href=\"?note=ee84ed8b0fae5bc3\" title=\"93-df-similarity-type\">93-df-similarity-type</a>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{JEP}(-;\\tau)\">\\(\\mathrm{JEP}(-;\\tau)\\)</span> (joint-embedding-property predicate defined here)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Emb}_{93}\">\\(\\mathrm{Emb}_{93}\\)</span> (embedding predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"d611f4ac8b8895ab\" href=\"?note=d611f4ac8b8895ab\" title=\"93-df-embedding\">93-df-embedding</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}jep}\\vdash \\mathrm{JEP}(\\mathcal K;\\tau)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{SimType}_{93}(\\tau)\\land\\mathcal K\\subseteq\\{\\mathbf A:\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}(\\mathbf A)\\}\\land\\forall\\mathbf A,\\mathbf B\\in\\mathcal K\\;\\exists\\mathbf C\\in\\mathcal K\\;\\exists f\\;\\exists g\\;(\\mathrm{Emb}_{93}(f,\\mathbf A,\\mathbf C)\\land\\mathrm{Emb}_{93}(g,\\mathbf B,\\mathbf C))\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}jep}\\vdash \\mathrm{JEP}(\\mathcal K;\\tau)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{SimType}_{93}(\\tau)\\land\\mathcal K\\subseteq\\{\\mathbf A:\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}(\\mathbf A)\\}\\land\\forall\\mathbf A,\\mathbf B\\in\\mathcal K\\;\\exists\\mathbf C\\in\\mathcal K\\;\\exists f\\;\\exists g\\;(\\mathrm{Emb}_{93}(f,\\mathbf A,\\mathbf C)\\land\\mathrm{Emb}_{93}(g,\\mathbf B,\\mathbf C))\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The explicit <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau\">\\(\\tau\\)</span> prevents a mixed-signature class from satisfying the displayed property accidentally.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"93-df-embedding","status":"resolved","id":"d611f4ac8b8895ab","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depend